  "body": "## Added\r\n\r\n* Support for the ext-data-control-v1 protocol\r\n* Outdated clipboard data is now zeroized once it is not needed anymore\r\n* Graceful shutdown\r\n\r\n## Changed\r\n\r\n* Default reconnect tries is now: 0 (#12)\r\n* More and better log messages\r\n\r\n## Workarounds\r\n\r\n* Added workaround for issue #17 (we now ignore the `SAVE_TARGETS` mime type)\r\n* Added workaround for issue #22 (we now request mime types in a specific order)\r\n\r\n## Building\r\n\r\n* New MSRV is: 1.85.0",
